### Counterparty

Counterparty is a protocol built on Bitcoin that enables asset issuance, decentralized exchange, and smart contracts.

**Documentation:**
- [What is Counterparty?](https://docs.counterparty.io/docs/basics/what-is-counterparty/) - Protocol overview and concepts
- [Counterparty API](https://counterpartycore.docs.apiary.io/) - Complete API reference

**Key Concepts:**
- **Asset Issuance**: Create named tokens on Bitcoin
- **Decentralized Exchange**: Trade assets without intermediaries
- **Proof-of-Burn**: XCP creation mechanism
- **Bitcoin Stamps Integration**: Many stamps use Counterparty assets

**Use Cases for StampFolio:**
- Fetching asset metadata for stamps
- Querying asset holders
- Transaction history
- Asset transfers and balances

**Common API Calls:**
```
get_asset_info - Get asset details
get_holders - Get asset holder addresses
get_balances - Get address balances
get_asset_names - Resolve asset names
```

